Phase 2 / H18 — Herdr clipboard privacy audit (doc §8.2-§8.3)

Target: zero automatic pasteboard reads; clipboard content never appears in
the echo / log surface; explicit copy / per-host auto-copy is the only path
that lets server clipboard bytes reach the system pasteboard.

